    "Spaces mean AND, a|b means OR, and !x excludes a term. Try ext:pdf, size:>1mb, dm:today, or regex:…. Paste actual paths, including spaces. The type, date, and size filters use the same syntax." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
